00:10:40,000 --> 00:10:46,000
Pitch Perfect is a comedy, music, romance film directed by Jason Moore.

3
00:16:00,000 --> 00:16:06,000
College student Beca knows she does not want to be part of a clique, but that's
exactly where she finds herself after arriving at her new school.

4
00:21:20,000 --> 00:21:26,000
Thrust in among mean gals, nice gals and just plain weird gals, Beca finds that
the only thing they have in common is how well they sing together.

5
00:26:40,000 --> 00:26:46,000
She takes the women of the group out of their comfort zone of traditional arrangements and into a world
of amazing harmonic combinations in a fight to the top of college music competitions.

6
